{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>H2O Reminder Pro 是一款以動畫水瓶記錄飲水量的 iOS 應用，適合想建立補水習慣或容易忘記喝水的人。此應用現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-238.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>動畫水瓶記錄補水</h2>\n<p>應用提供會隨飲水量上升的動畫水瓶，以波浪效果和音效呈現補水進度，點按一下即可記錄。你可自訂每日目標（1.5 公升至 3 公升），並在早上、下午和晚上接收智能提醒；另設 7 日記錄、主畫面小工具、8 種語言、淺色與深色主題、觸感回饋及水滴音效。無需帳戶亦可離線使用，資料只保留在裝置上。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-280-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-281-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-282-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-283-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-284-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-285-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：H2O Reminder Pro</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/h2o-reminder-pro/id6746629890?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:14:58.911449+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":294,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:57:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:36.630468+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:08:18.778624+00:00","content_hash":"df246e28ea5c3ef92b6db86107ec759b7cc40939c113c6b51e25a4f768fb9791","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}